                                                "example_id": "065f53b1-b86a-4d02-8273-f8de9675e602",
                                                "sense_id": "bf1a5553-6fe8-3eff-9f85-c5d1e76bc148",
                                                "text": "It might seem that Mr. Holl, whose initial sketches are glorious watercolors, was an unlikely candidate for a job that is all about hydrodynamics. But he credits much of his inspiration to repeated meetings with engineers -- as many as 30 at a time -- to discuss topics like \"flocculation\" (the process by which particles form coagulated masses, or flocs)."
